{
  "name": "mu2023_cp_toploaded_cell",
  "units": "mm",
  "description": "CP top-loaded-patch TCDA unit cell (Mu et al., AEU Int. J. Electron. Commun. 170 (2023) 154810, Fig. 1 / Table 1): ring dipoles, two-layer folded coupling patches, circular top-loaded patch, F4B stack, Y-shaped feed lines on top of h3 (x-pol line bridged under the y-pol line on the dipole layer); periodic walls + Floquet port. port:1 = x-pol, port:2 = y-pol coax apertures at the ground plane; drive with 90 deg offset to emulate the omitted FR4 phase-shifter layer (h6).",
